@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@token = paste-a-bearer-token-here

### List breweries from the SQLite catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/breweries?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter and sort the SQLite catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/breweries?city=Denver&sortBy=name&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sort by distance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/breweries?sortBy=distance&latitude=39.7392&longitude=-104.9903&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Autocomplete
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/breweries/autocomplete?term=den&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unauthorized request (remove the Authorization header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/breweries
